	(text "USB-C board\nBare breakout: receptacle and J701 only, no parts. The 5.1k CC resistors and the ESD\nsit on the main board, so any USB-C breakout or panel socket that brings out VBUS, D-,\nD+, CC1, CC2 and GND can replace this board (without its own 5.1k, or leave R301/R302 off).\nJ701 to the main board's J_USB (XH 6). Cable <= 15 cm for USB full speed.\nFit this board or USB301 on the main board, not both."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 38.1 152.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
